name: sim.setScriptAttribute
description: 
luaSynopsis: sim.setScriptAttribute(int scriptHandle,int attributeID,number/bool attribute)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. scriptHandle: handle of a script
2. attributeID: the script attributeID
3. floatVal: the floating point attribute (if applicable)
4. intOrBoolVal: the integer or bool attribute (if applicable)
